d","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-25T17:37:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-25T20:20:56Z","closed_at":"2025-06-25T20:20:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5-beta1\n- Behavior appears to have been present since this method was first introduced in 449df8f68808\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\n`ArrayMesh::surface_get_lods()` returns bogus index data for all LODs.  The index array for each LOD simply repeats a single index value over and over, instead of returning the correct data.\n\nThe bug is here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/30456ba095c425d5ecde320a96a763afb93bbcb0/servers/rendering_server.cpp#L1733-L1735\nThis loop is attempting to copy the LOD indices from the SurfaceData to the return value, but incorrectly uses the surface number (`i`) instead of the loop index (`j`) when copying data out.  This results in just copying the same value over and over again.\n\nIn particular this breaks SoftBody3D, which makes a copy of the input mesh it is given.  It attempts to copy the LODs from the input mesh to the new mesh, but copies bogus LOD information as a result of this bug.  Because of this the new mesh does not show up when rendered, as each LOD only refers to a single vertex.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the attached MRP.  The imported cube mesh gets a single auto-generated LOD, and it does not render when used by SoftBody3D.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mesh_get_lods_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20908379/mesh_get_lods_bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107984/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}